diff --git a/packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md b/packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md
index d8e1ee9eef4f084856fe7de4c359b92614d03d98..e21e842f937eea0c9807c1f32d53c016cb563e22 100644
--- a/packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/packages/coding-agent/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -4,6 +4,7 @@
 
 ### Added
 
+- Added a Runtime-owned Studio loop service shared by the Bridge and `studio-host` TUI, with pause, prompt capture, turn/time limits, state projection, and shutdown cleanup.
 - Added presentation-neutral Studio session controls for queue, context reset, retry, prompt, steer, follow-up, and abort, with truthful limited handling for destructive session drop.
 - Added Runtime-authoritative Studio command arbitration and shared pause/resume services with fenced pause epochs, receipts, and state events.
 - Added Runtime-owned Studio state snapshots with epoch fencing and reconnect recovery.
@@ -13,6 +14,7 @@
 
 ### Fixed
 
+- Fixed Studio Loop initial-prompt failures leaving the scheduler enabled, duplicate projected state changes, and Runtime cleanup being skipped when Bridge shutdown fails.
 - Fixed rejected Studio requests being duplicated across retries, stale socket receipts crossing a reconnect boundary, and snapshots blocking behind an in-flight command.
 - Fixed a Studio Bridge shutdown race that could surface an unhandled initial-snapshot rejection.
 
